---
description: Run bSmart /project and /role through the shared adapter
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user uses `/project` or `/role`, run `python bSmart-System/integrations/bsmart_client_adapter.py` with that command and the user's arguments. Reply with stdout unchanged. Never confirm rename, retire, or delete yourself.

If the session already contains a `bSmart — Startup` block, do not run `bStart.py` again. Otherwise run `python bSmart-System/bStart.py` once before the first reply and preserve its startup lines.
